// Deal or Force - the layout audit.
//
// Five times a caption in this game has been given less room than its own text and
// shown up as something else entirely - a column of single letters, an empty space,
// two stray dots, a sentence that appeared to begin mid-word. The `layout` console
// command names them in one go, and in a debug build the same audit runs on its own
// once a second over whatever is on screen.
{
  "Every visible caption has room for its own text.": "Every visible caption has room for its own text.",
  "{0} caption(s) have not been given room for their text:": "{0} caption(s) have not been given room for their text:"
}
